# Definition of Done — openpro-connector-sdk

**Not done until every applicable item passes.**

## 1. Scope & quality

- [ ] Every changed line traces to the request
- [ ] Pelloux limits: file ≤400 lines, function ≤25 lines
- [ ] No secrets, no `console.*`, no type escape hatches
- [ ] Orphans from your diff removed

## 2. Tests (mandatory for behavior changes)

- [ ] Happy path + error path covered
- [ ] Bug fix includes regression test
- [ ] See `testing-standards.mdc`

```bash

```

## 3. Static checks (pre-commit)

```bash
bash scripts/check-quality.sh
pnpm exec tsc --noEmit 2>/dev/null 
```

## 4. Pre-push

```bash
pnpm exec tsc --noEmit 2>/dev/null 
 npm run typecheck --if-present
```



## Done means

Tests lock behavior, hooks pass, build succeeds — not "I think it works."
